  "assessments": [
    "Eager RelayPeer immediately owns the coordinator through ConnectionPeer; unpolled owner Drop requests abort. No detached cleanup task was introduced.",
    "The coordinator owns accepted receivers and queued delayed sends through actual JoinSet tasks before fallible handle publication. Parent cancellation destroys this concrete child owner and requests child abort.",
